
@Clientes.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5057

### Cadastrar cliente
POST {{Clientes.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Bruno da Silva",
  "dataNascimento": "2000-05-15T00:00:00",
  "cpf": "52998224725",
  "email": "bruno.teste@example.com"
}

### Buscar cliente por ID
GET {{Clientes.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/clientes/CD15E362-D4B5-463C-8B06-5602B859DA64
Accept: application/json
